    stem: `A 38-year-old lab technician gets top performance reviews, and her supervisor calls her the most reliable person on the team. She, however, finds the work dull and says the job ignores her need for variety and creative input. In Dawis and Lofquist's theory of work adjustment, how is her situation BEST described?`,
