    difficulty: 'medium',
    stem: `A 26-year-old says, "I feel like a failure because I never had a career plan. I only got into event planning because I helped at a friend's wedding and a guest offered me work." Which counselor response BEST reflects Krumboltz's happenstance learning theory?`,
